WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
- It's been a few, (laughs)

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.710
a few years since we've
seen each other, right?

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:04.690
- It has been a few years.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.250
I can't see you at all.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.106
I see a big white screen

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:08.150
that says Kelly Clarkson.
- Wow, you're missing out

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.490
because I look hot.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:12.660
I look so good right now.
(audience laughs)

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:13.493
You are missing-

00:00:13.493 --> 00:00:17.550
- Is there any way on my Zoom land I can-

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.399
- You should promptly

00:00:18.399 --> 00:00:19.232
figure it out, Neil
- There you are!

00:00:19.232 --> 00:00:20.190
- Yeah, exactly.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.009
- Oh my gosh! What?
- You're welcome.

00:00:23.009 --> 00:00:25.717
- You are living in your pink greatness.

00:00:25.717 --> 00:00:27.650
- Yes, with someone else's hair, Neil,

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.100
but it's fine.
(audience laughs)

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.137
- I almost wore that.

00:00:31.137 --> 00:00:34.850
- (laughs) You'd probably
look better, you jerk.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:37.897
So wait, I actually just
celebrated 18 years since "Idol,"

00:00:37.897 --> 00:00:39.080
and it made me think of you

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.540
because I remember you telling me,

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.380
'cause somebody was talking
about "A Moment Like This,"

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.010
that people use it for weddings a lot,

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.040
and I was like, I remember Neil telling me

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.810
that was that y'all's dance?

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:48.643
Was that the song that you?

00:00:48.643 --> 00:00:50.790
- That was our first dance song.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:53.060
That was our song, Kelly Clarkson!

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:54.510
- I love it!
- We don't have

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.410
many people in our lives that we talk

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.418
like 13-year-old school girls about.

00:01:00.418 --> 00:01:01.251
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:01.251 --> 00:01:03.700
And you are one of them,

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.610
and that song, we met during,

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.620
I think, season two of "American Idol"

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:11.600
when it was still this giant juggernaut.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:12.990
And I think that your song,

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:16.350
that song was playing a lot
and was still connected with.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:19.450
And so we were falling in
love at that same time,

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:22.410
and the lyrics to that song
always kind of stayed with us.

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.340
And we always said if we ever got married,

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:27.710
that would be a great first dance song,

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:28.738
especially with two guys.

00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:32.130
Some people wait a lifetime
for a moment like this.

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:35.080
Some people search forever
for that one special kiss.

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:37.100
It was so perfect.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.256
And our parents were there
and we got to dance with them.

00:01:39.256 --> 00:01:40.716
- Oh my god, I love your smile.

00:01:40.716 --> 00:01:42.231
You're like reliving it.
- And it was to your voice.

00:01:42.231 --> 00:01:43.215
(Kelly laughs)

